  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Flesh Whip Immortal’s walking meat tree forces Western Desert Immortal Gu Houses to retreat. Heavenly Court rank eights were awakened in advance and are already active. Dong clan answers with Red River Wheel, a rank seven house shaped like a water wheel or giant tire that rotates in red flames and charges that tree; that wheel is a different house from Jade Toad Castle. Zhang Fei Xiong turns into a giant with a bear head and human body and charges the wheel to defend her.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
