    {
      "text": "Someone names Red River Wheel’s sides as the weakest and calls to help Dong clan, and Jade Toad Castle strikes Zhang Fei Xiong. He is knocked away by the Immortal Gu House, then returns and takes Flesh Whip Immortal’s place while she refuses to withdraw.",
